{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":29,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的命運"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"唉！亞利伊勒，亞利伊勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大衛安營的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任憑你年上加年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"節期照常周流。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我終必使亞利伊勒困難；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必悲傷哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻仍以她為亞利伊勒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必四圍安營攻擊你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屯兵圍困你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"築壘攻擊你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必敗落，從地中說話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言語必微細出於塵埃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的聲音必像那交鬼者的聲音出於地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言語低低微微出於塵埃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你仇敵的群眾，卻要像細塵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強暴人的群眾，也要像飛糠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這事必頃刻之間忽然臨到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必用雷轟、地震、大聲、旋風、暴風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並吞滅的火焰，向她討罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，攻擊亞利伊勒列國的群眾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是一切攻擊亞利伊勒和她的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並使她困難的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必如夢景，如夜間的異象；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必像飢餓的人夢中吃飯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒了仍覺腹空；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或像口渴的人夢中喝水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒了仍覺發昏，心裏想喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊錫安山列國的群眾也必如此。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["沒有人聽警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"你們等候驚奇吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們宴樂昏迷吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們醉了，卻非因酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們東倒西歪，卻非因濃酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華將沉睡的靈澆灌你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封閉你們的眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙蓋你們的頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的眼就是先知；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的頭就是先見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["所有的默示，你們看如封住的書卷，人將這書卷交給識字的，說：「請念吧！」他說：「我不能念，因為是封住了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又將這書卷交給不識字的人，說：「請念吧！」他說：「我不識字。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主說：因為這百姓親近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用嘴唇尊敬我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心卻遠離我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們敬畏我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不過是領受人的吩咐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我在這百姓中要行奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是奇妙又奇妙的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們智慧人的智慧必然消滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聰明人的聰明必然隱藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["將來的希望"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"禍哉！那些向耶和華深藏謀略的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又在暗中行事，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰看見我們呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰知道我們呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們把事顛倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈可看窯匠如泥嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被製作的物豈可論製作物的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他沒有製作我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或是被創造的物論造物的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他沒有聰明？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"黎巴嫩變為肥田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥田看如樹林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是只有一點點時候嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，聾子必聽見這書上的話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瞎子的眼必從迷矇黑暗中得以看見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謙卑人必因耶和華增添歡喜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人間貧窮的必因以色列的聖者快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，強暴人已歸無有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"褻慢人已經滅絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一切找機會作孽的都被剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在爭訟的事上定無罪的為有罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為城門口責備人的設下網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用虛無的事屈枉義人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"所以，救贖亞伯拉罕的耶和華","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"論雅各家如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各必不再羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"面容也不致變色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他看見他的眾子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我手的工作在他那裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必尊我的名為聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊雅各的聖者為聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必敬畏以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中迷糊的必得明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發怨言的必受訓誨。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}